    "## 5. 分层评估策略 —— 从 offline batch 到 online eval\n",
    "\n",
    "**分层评估的 3 层**：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Offline batch eval（评估集）**\n",
    "   - 跑 30-100 题 eval set\n",
    "   - 算所有 5 个指标的 mean\n",
    "   - **目标**：识别 baseline 弱点\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Online A/B test（灰度）**\n",
    "   - 灰度 10% → 30% → 100% 流量\n",
    "   - 对比两个版本的指标（如 faithfulness / answer_correctness）\n",
    "   - **目标**：验证改动是否有效\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Real-time monitor（监控）**\n",
    "   - 监控每条 query 的 metric（延迟 / faithfulness / answer_relevance）\n",
    "   - 设置 alert（如 faithfulness < 0.6 时报警）\n",
    "   - **目标**：检测 drift（数据分布变化 / 模型退化）\n",
    "\n",
    "**RAGAS 的官方实现支持**：\n",
    "- `sampler`：分层采样（sample 100 题做 full eval，其他做 quick eval）\n",
    "- `corpus`：评估整个知识库的质量\n",
    "- `async`：支持异步评估（适合大规模 eval）\n",
    "\n",
    "**推荐评估 pipeline**：\n",
    "```\n",
    "Offline batch eval (30 题) → identify weak cases → \n",
    "Design intervention (chunking / rerank / prompt) → \n",
    "A/B test (10% → 30% → 100%) → verify improvement → \n",
    "Monitor (faithfulness / latency) on live traffic\n",
    "```"
   ]
