    "## 6. 实战建议 —— 什么时候用 rule-based，什么时候用 LLM-as-judge\n",
    "\n",
    "**Rule-based（OFFLINE 模式）**：\n",
    "- ✅ 适合**回归测试**：每次改动后跑，看指标是否改善\n",
    "- ✅ 适合**debug**：快速定位问题\n",
    "- ❌ 不适合**online A/B test**（bias 偏大）\n",
    "\n",
    "**LLM-as-judge（ONLINE 模式）**：\n",
    "- ✅ 适合**online A/B test**：更真实，更接近用户视角\n",
    "- ✅ 适合**complex metric**（如 answer_correctness 用 rouge / semantic similarity）\n",
    "- ❌ **成本高**：每个 query 都要调 LLM（10x latency）\n",
    "- ❌ **bias 偏大**：需要缓解（rubric / pairwise / 多 LLM 投票）\n",
    "\n",
    "**混合策略**：\n",
    "- Offline batch：用 rule-based 快速迭代（省钱）\n",
    "- Online A/B test：用 LLM-as-judge 验证（更真实）\n",
    "- Real-time monitor：用 rule-based（快）+ LLM-as-judge 稀疏采样（高精度）"
